                <pb facs="0465" n="453" sameAs="frus:frus1940v03/pg453"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.6131/591: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in the Soviet
                        Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Thurston</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1940-08-03T14:00:00-04:00">August 3, 1940—2
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>413. Your 954, August 2, 7 p.m. For your information consideration is still being
                    given to the desirability of including the coal notes in the renewal of the
                    agreement.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
